{
    "background_story": "Aliya was a free-spirited interior designer with a passion for creating cozy spaces. She believed that a comfortable home was the key to a happy life. Growing up in a family of modest means, Aliya learned to repurpose and upcycle furniture to create inviting atmospheres. As her design business took off, she became known for her ability to transform even the most mundane spaces into warm and welcoming havens. Aliya's own home was a testament to her philosophy, filled with plush textiles, soft lighting, and plush throw blankets. She loved nothing more than curling up with a good book and a cup of tea in her favorite armchair, surrounded by the comforting familiarity of her own design. For Aliya, comfort was not just a physical state, but a state of mind \u2013 and she was dedicated to helping others find it in their own homes.",
